# Everything the daemon receives in the build context CAN end up in a layer.
# Anyone who can pull the image can read every layer.
#
# NOTE(LAB): These are not _exactly_ .gitignore patterns
#           Docker matches each one against the whole path.
#           so `__pycache__/` catches only the directory at the root.
#           Use `**/` to catch every depth.

